# Keep large local media out of the repo (GitHub caps files at 100 MB).
# The hero uses a self-hosted MP4, so track that one file (Video.mp4, ~74 MB,
# 720p faststart) and ignore everything else — e.g. the uncompressed source
# Video.source.mp4 (~978 MB) that Video.mp4 was compressed from.
*.mp4
!Video.mp4
